WEBVTT

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:36.839 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.910 line:0%
[Episode 20]

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:42.360 line:0%
Give it to me.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.029 line:0%
I'll give you credit for being observant.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.930 line:0%
Let's check that out.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.640 line:0%
That's interesting.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.330 line:0%
They have fortune-telling slips here.

00:01:55.339 --> 00:01:56.740 line:0%
Let's draw one.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.040 line:0%
A gentleman doesn't engage in superstitions.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.480 line:0%
You're at Mingsheng Temple now.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.160 line:0%
Stop saying things like that.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.220 line:0%
Let's go, let's go.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.250 line:0%
[Fortune-telling Slips]

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:16.500 line:0%
[Sacred Ancestor Divination Slips]

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.840 line:0%
Slip No. 24?

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.390 line:0%
Give it a try.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:23.910 line:0%
I...

00:02:28.379 --> 00:02:30.270 line:0%
[Slip No. 24]

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:36.360 line:0%
Slip No. 24 again?

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:37.879 line:0%
No, no.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:38.800 line:0%
I must have placed it wrong.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:39.580 line:0%
Let me try again.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.550 line:0%
[Sacred Ancestor Divination Slips]

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.070 line:0%
[Slip No. 24]

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:48.870 line:0%
[Sacred Ancestor Divination Slips]

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:49.240 line:0%
It's still Slip No. 24?

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.060 line:0%
It's...

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:53.720 line:0%
Alright.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.120 line:0%
Since it's Slip No. 24 every time,

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:57.000 line:0%
let's see

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.400 line:0%
what it says.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:01.860 line:0%
Over there.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:28.720 line:0%
No. 24.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.190 line:0%
In your past life, you were destined to meet,

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:40.680 line:0%
and now, the time has come.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.150 line:0%
What does this mean?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:49.920 line:0%
Why is this place so big

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:52.480 line:0%
and there's no one here to explain the divination?

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.280 line:0%
Wait.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:55.900 line:0%
This fortune-telling slip definitely isn't accurate.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.560 line:0%
I think it's pretty accurate.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:00.510 line:0%
A gentleman doesn't engage in superstitions.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:05.400 line:0%
Destined?

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.010 line:0%
Isn't that pretty accurate?

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.160 line:0%
Chuichui?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.320 line:0%
Chuichui?

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.440 line:0%
Do you have feelings for me?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.590 line:0%
Don't listen to her nonsense.

00:04:18.509 --> 00:04:19.540 line:0%
Xu,

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.190 line:0%
in my heart,

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.200 line:0%
you truly are different from the others.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.680 line:0%
But that's because

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:25.840 line:0%
you never look down

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.320 line:0%
on women handling cases,

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.440 line:0%
unlike the others in the six ministries.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.160 line:0%
You always

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.560 line:0%
sincerely help me.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.580 line:0%
So, in my heart,

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.280 line:0%
I've long regarded you

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.440 line:0%
as my real elder brother.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.650 line:0%
But it's only respect.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.600 line:0%
I absolutely have no other feelings for you.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.500 line:0%
See?

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.430 line:0%
That's good, that's good.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.300 line:0%
How about this?

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.120 line:0%
If

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.000 line:0%
you don't mind

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.800 line:0%
and are willing to accept me as your elder brother,

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.880 line:0%
I would be truly delighted.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:54.480 line:0%
Brother Xu.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.600 line:0%
My good Sixth Sister.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.080 line:0%
Since that's the case,

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.270 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:00.920 line:0%
let's make a vow

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.520 line:0%
in front of Mingsheng Temple

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.590 line:0%
today.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:04.950 line:0%
From now on,

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.160 line:0%
we'll be sworn brother and sister.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:12.560 line:0%
As your elder brother, I'll give you this token.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.840 line:0%
Holding this token,

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.730 line:0%
you can command all the constables

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.390 line:0%
in the areas you pass through.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.160 line:0%
This is not appropriate.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.080 line:0%
Brother Xu,

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.760 line:0%
this is your command token as the Constable Marshal.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:22.720 line:0%
It's not because of this iron token

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.310 line:0%
that I can command the constables

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.820 line:0%
all over the world.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.880 line:0%
Come on, take it.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.680 line:0%
I really can't. I really can't.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.940 line:0%
It's alright. Take it.

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:35.090 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:35.560 line:0%
In times of danger,

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.080 line:0%
it might save your life.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.160 line:0%
Then thank you very much, Brother Xu.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.970 line:0%
That's more like it.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.680 line:0%
Well, I'll take my leave now.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.360 line:0%
Sixth Sister.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.030 line:0%
Even Commander Xu can't attract your interest?

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.040 line:0%
Yun Que.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.200 line:0%
You should learn more good things

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.400 line:0%
from Lu Chuichui.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.880 line:0%
You're so strange.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.280 line:0%
I can understand that

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.240 line:0%
you don't like White Ghost.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.480 line:0%
But Commander Xu

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.640 line:0%
is a man of passion and heroism.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.800 line:0%
Shouldn't he be the hero

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.000 line:0%
in every girl's dreams?

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.930 line:0%
How come you don't like him either?

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.120 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:19.720 line:0%
could it be that

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.210 line:0%
there's something wrong with your brain?

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:21.830 line:0%
I...

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.760 line:0%
Why does it feel like

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.280 line:0%
you're acting just like

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.360 line:0%
when you criticized me

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.620 line:0%
for not liking Shen Du?

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.750 line:0%
Could it be...

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.620 line:0%
that you have feelings for Commander Xu?

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.540 line:0%
Is there a problem with that?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.340 line:0%
Commander Xu saved my life.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:45.600 line:0%
Also,

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.050 line:0%
he's so manly.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.400 line:0%
When he had doubts, he came and asked you straightforwardly,

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.440 line:0%
openly and aboveboard,

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.520 line:0%
without a hint of jealousy.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.520 line:0%
Unlike a specific man who doesn't have a mouth,

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.290 line:0%
keeping everything, good or bad, bottled up inside.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.090 line:0%
It feels like he's ready to set you up at any moment.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.440 line:0%
Your preferences

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.570 line:0%
change pretty fast.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:04.790 line:0%
Anyway,

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:05.800 line:0%
Commander Xu is my charming,

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.770 line:0%
handsome and ideal husband.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.280 line:0%
Fortunately, you're not competing with me this time.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.480 line:0%
I won't have to share a man

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.440 line:0%
with you anymore.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.240 line:0%
We didn't need to share a man in the first place.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.500 line:0%
I've made my decision.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:15.240 line:0%
What?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.840 line:0%
I'm leaving Shen's Mansion.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:19.240 line:0%
I've had enough

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.400 line:0%
of that moody White Ghost.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.760 line:0%
I'm going to join Constable Marshal

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.120 line:0%
and become a female constable

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.280 line:0%
who upholds justice.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.080 line:0%
Good!

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.250 line:0%
I support you.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:28.900 line:0%
If Commander Xu doesn't take you in,

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:31.490 line:0%
I'll sit in protest at their doorstep with you.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:32.410 line:0%
My good sister!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.020 line:0%
You...

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.170 line:0%
Where's Jiang Langxing?

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.620 line:0%
He's too rigid

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:38.360 line:0%
and too boring.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.420 line:0%
I got rid of him.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.450 line:0%
This beauty snake is truly breathtaking.

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:50.630 line:0%
So beautiful.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.670 line:0%
Why are there so many people?

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.510 line:0%
It's not even the main hall.

00:07:56.459 --> 00:07:57.330 line:0%
Xing?

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.080 line:0%
Secretary Lu?

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.670 line:0%
Why are you all here?

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.110 line:0%
Pan?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:09.960 line:0%
Lu Chuichui,

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.420 line:0%
when will you stop?

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:13.510 line:0%
How many people are you calling over?

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.670 line:0%
I didn't ask him to come.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.440 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.800 line:0%
Shouldn't I be here?

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.180 line:0%
It's so lively here.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.570 line:0%
I'm Pan Chi.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.820 line:0%
It's in my nature to join in on the fun.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:26.600 line:0%
Are you here to see the beauty snake too?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.330 line:0%
-Beauty snake?
-Beauty snake?

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:33.520 line:0%
Pan, are you alright?

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:34.440 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.709 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.120 line:0%
Stop hiding.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.400 line:0%
I've already seen you.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.200 line:0%
Madam.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.000 line:0%
I...

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.600 line:0%
Jing Lin?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.800 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.200 line:0%
I...

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.200 line:0%
I...

00:08:58.520 --> 00:08:59.640 line:0%
I'm here to look after you

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.720 line:0%
for the Grand Commander,

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.210 line:0%
in case someone has ill intentions.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.320 line:0%
Who are you talking about?

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:08.000 line:0%
I'm talking about

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.060 line:0%
whoever you think I'm talking about.

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.580 line:0%
Did Shen Du send you to follow me?

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.290 line:0%
Is he alright?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.080 line:0%
He's not.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.580 line:0%
Of course he's not.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.200 line:0%
Madam,

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.280 line:0%
during these days you've been away from the mansion,

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:29.200 line:0%
the Grand Commander

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.280 line:0%
has been having

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.640 line:0%
no appetite every day

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:33.520 line:0%
and has lost

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.160 line:0%
a lot of weight.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.320 line:0%
It's only been half a day,

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:40.620 line:0%
and he's already lost weight?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.240 line:0%
Not only has he lost weight,

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.700 line:0%
but he also looks haggard.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.740 line:0%
Every night, the Grand Commander

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.640 line:0%
calls out your name.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:51.560 line:0%
Like this:

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:53.800 line:0%
Xing!

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.160 line:0%
Don't leave!

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.320 line:0%
Xing!

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:01.480 line:0%
Did he...

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.220 line:0%
really say that?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.480 line:0%
I didn't expect he's so dependent...

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.070 line:0%
Well, if that's the case,

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.720 line:0%
I'll go back with you,

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:22.120 line:0%
so he doesn't end up with any lasting illness

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.180 line:0%
and blame me for it.

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:25.720 line:0%
Xing,

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.560 line:0%
are you leaving already?

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.040 line:0%
Shen Du is injured.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.040 line:0%
I need to go back and take care of him.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.640 line:0%
You stubborn fool.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:35.960 line:0%
Bye.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.000 line:0%
Alright, alright, let's not care about her.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:42.960 line:0%
She's such a mood killer.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:43.840 line:0%
Let's watch the beauty snake.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:44.840 line:0%
The beauty snake.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.080 line:0%
Excuse me.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.400 line:0%
Excuse me, excuse me.

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:50.890 line:0%
Excuse me, excuse me.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.320 line:0%
Oh my god.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.370 line:0%
It really is a beauty snake.

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.030 line:0%
So beautiful.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:00.840 line:0%
She gave up the chance

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.440 line:0%
to ascend to immortality

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.760 line:0%
and specifically came to the mortal world

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.840 line:0%
to share the immortal elixirs she cultivated

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.500 line:0%
for 1000 years with all of you.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.600 line:0%
Immortal elixirs?

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.320 line:0%
This elixir is called Celestial Beauty Pill.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.680 line:0%
When women take it,

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.840 line:0%
it makes their skin snow white

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.380 line:0%
and their beauty naturally shine.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.110 line:0%
With it, unmarried women can find a good husband.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.000 line:0%
Men can also get some

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.160 line:0%
to gift to their beloved ones.

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:26.440 line:0%
The beauty snake blesses

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.920 line:0%
all lovers in the world

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.490 line:0%
and may your love last forever.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:35.840 line:0%
Beauty snake, please grant us the Celestial Beauty Pills.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:39.240 line:0%
Everyone,

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.210 line:0%
Celestial Beauty Pills are worth a fortune,

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.600 line:0%
and the quantity is limited.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:44.760 line:0%
If you want them,

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.520 line:0%
you can exchange ten gold coins for one bottle.

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.280 line:0%
-Making my skin snow white
-So expensive?

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.010 line:0%
and my beauty naturally shine?

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:51.520 line:0%
Do you think there's a reason

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:52.780 line:0%
why it's so expensive?

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:53.680 line:0%
That's right.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:54.880 line:0%
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:57.760 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:00.290 line:0%
Today's Celestial Beauty Pills are sold out.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.680 line:0%
Already?

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.720 line:0%
I've been here three times

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:03.800 line:0%
and still haven't gotten any.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.480 line:0%
If you still want them,

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.850 line:0%
come back in three days.

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:09.360 line:0%
Let's come back another day.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.160 line:0%
Let's go.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.200 line:0%
How are you feeling today?

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.800 line:0%
Is your wound still hurting?

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:40.520 line:0%
No.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.640 line:0%
Why do you look

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.280 line:0%
so gloomy?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:50.920 line:0%
Is that so?

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:53.720 line:0%
Well, Honey, why do you

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:54.800 line:0%
look so happy?

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.520 line:0%
Did you find a good match?

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:58.620 line:0%
Didn't Jing Lin say...

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:06.240 line:0%
You seem to be doing quite well.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:07.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.480 line:0%
With my wife not home,

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.480 line:0%
I enjoyed the peace and quiet,

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.080 line:0%
so of course, I'm doing well.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.020 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.620 line:0%
You met Xu Xiangren?

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.080 line:0%
Yes.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.020 line:0%
I happened to run into him. Is that a problem?

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:32.830 line:0%
You just happened to run into him?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.880 line:0%
At Mingsheng Temple, where people go to pray for marriage?

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:35.960 line:0%
And he gave the Constable Marshal's token

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:36.760 line:0%
to you?

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.970 line:0%
Brother Xu gave me this

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:38.910 line:0%
as a gesture of brother-sister affection.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:39.940 line:0%
Don't overthink it.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:40.700 line:0%
I...

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.340 line:0%
What is there for me to overthink?

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:52.680 line:0%
Yes, indeed.

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.230 line:0%
There's nothing you need to overthink.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.400 line:0%
After you've recovered,

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.280 line:0%
why don't you also visit Mingsheng Temple

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.000 line:0%
and pray?

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.320 line:0%
It's very effective.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.240 line:0%
You might

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.960 line:0%
really get what you wish for.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.690 line:0%
What could I possibly wish for?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:18.720 line:0%
Stop crying!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:19.880 line:0%
Stop making noise!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:21.520 line:0%
Ma'am,

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.920 line:0%
my stomach really hurts.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.540 line:0%
Can I get down for a while?

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:29.440 line:0%
I shouldn't have let you

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:30.360 line:0%
eat at night.

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:31.320 line:0%
Take it slow.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:32.680 line:0%
Don't dirty that skin.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:34.720 line:0%
Thank you, Ma'am.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.760 line:0%
Bao, come out.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.430 line:0%
Go and stand guard at the door.

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.420 line:0%
Alright.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.820 line:0%
Pretending to be mysterious.

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.360 line:0%
What beauty snake that ascended?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:55.620 line:0%
This is clearly

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:57.810 line:0%
a trafficker's den for young girls.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.160 line:0%
Miss,

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.080 line:0%
farewell.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:08.790 line:0%
You...

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.920 line:0%
I don't have

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:15.440 line:0%
anything valuable on me.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.520 line:0%
Maybe...

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.240 line:0%
this is worth something.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.460 line:0%
I'll give it to you.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:25.760 line:0%
Here.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:26.840 line:0%
Take it.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.260 line:0%
How do you have Fire Moth Jade?

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.040 line:0%
Are you from the Fire Moth Sect?

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.300 line:0%
This isn't mine.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:38.360 line:0%
When I was abducted

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.760 line:0%
in Gannan Area, they took

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:40.920 line:0%
all my belongings.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.290 line:0%
This came from the person who deceived me.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:44.840 line:0%
So,

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.540 line:0%
you were abducted in Gannan Area?

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.100 line:0%
Did the person who abducted you

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.440 line:0%
come from Xiang'an?

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.880 line:0%
From the sound of his accent,

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.100 line:0%
he should be from Gannan Area.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:02.210 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect rose in Xiang'an

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.100 line:0%
in a very short period of time.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.440 line:0%
How did it spread

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.900 line:0%
to Gannan Area so quickly?

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:09.760 line:0%
Wait.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.800 line:0%
When were you abducted?

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:16.320 line:0%
I can't remember exactly,

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:18.540 line:0%
but it must have been a few months ago.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.360 line:0%
Miss,

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.050 line:0%
do you still remember the way back home?

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:27.540 line:0%
I have a way

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.840 line:0%
to travel between the Western Region and Jinwu Tribe.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:30.560 line:0%
How about this?

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:31.440 line:0%
Come with me,

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.820 line:0%
and I'll help you find

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.720 line:0%
a merchant caravan to the Western Region.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.520 line:0%
Really?

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:36.960 line:0%
Let's go.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.320 line:0%
Can you really go to the court?

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.080 line:0%
Your wound hasn't healed yet.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.140 line:0%
It's not good for you to move around.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.540 line:0%
It's just going to court,

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:54.200 line:0%
not investigating cases or chasing criminals.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.460 line:0%
If I don't show up soon,

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.930 line:0%
many people will think you're about to become a widow

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.520 line:0%
Well, be careful.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:11.760 line:0%
These days,

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.379 line:0%
-thank...
-Grand Commander!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.149 line:0%
Grand Commander, Madam,

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.760 line:0%
A verbal decree has come from the palace,

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:24.629 line:0%
saying that the Grand Empress Dowager

00:17:24.629 --> 00:17:27.090 line:0%
has summoned Madam to the palace to meet her.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:45.970 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:48.680 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, scribe from the Ministry of Justice,

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.610 line:0%
respectfully greet Your Majesty.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.430 line:0%
There are no outsiders here.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:55.380 line:0%
You don't need to be so formal.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:56.800 line:0%
Get up quickly.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:01.560 line:0%
In the Chen Huo'e case,

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.560 line:0%
Shen Du has made significant contributions.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.400 line:0%
I haven't decided yet

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.080 line:0%
how to reward him.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:08.560 line:0%
Tell me,

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:11.190 line:0%
how should I reward him this time?

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.690 line:0%
Both favor and disgrace

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.680 line:0%
are granted by the Emperor's grace.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.930 line:0%
Your Majesty, whether you reward him or not,

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.420 line:0%
my husband and I will be deeply grateful.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.580 line:0%
With no official rank,

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.570 line:0%
you've mastered all the courtesies

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.570 line:0%
of the bureaucratic world.

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:30.090 line:0%
My apologies, Your Majesty.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:31.480 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.200 line:0%
why are you giving Miss Yan a hard time?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:35.640 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.310 line:0%
already leads the Imperial Security Bureau

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.440 line:0%
and has also taken on the role of Capital Guard.

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.200 line:0%
He cannot

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.680 line:0%
be promoted any further.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.800 line:0%
Why don't you grant Miss Yan

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:45.800 line:0%
something more practical instead?

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.940 line:0%
You are quite willing to protect her.

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.560 line:0%
I just feel that

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:52.480 line:0%
Miss Yan's determination

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.200 line:0%
to become a female official

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.780 line:0%
reminds me of myself in my younger years,

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.770 line:0%
so I find her relatable.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.500 line:0%
Since that is the case,

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:05.880 line:0%
I'll promote Scribe Yan Xing

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.280 line:0%
to the position of Document Secretary.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.080 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:15.840 line:0%
I was originally going to take

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.920 line:0%
this year's female official examination.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.580 line:0%
I want to earn the position of Document Secretary

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:22.380 line:0%
in the Ministry of Justice through my own ability.

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:25.400 line:0%
Of course, you must rely on your own ability

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.840 line:0%
to pass the examination.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.200 line:0%
The female official examination of the six ministries

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.880 line:0%
determines promotions and demotions based on ability.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:32.960 line:0%
Her Majesty

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.700 line:0%
granting you the title of Document Secretary

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.680 line:0%
is to give you a greater challenge.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.000 line:0%
If you take the exam as a scribe,

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.160 line:0%
failing will mean remaining a scribe,

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.280 line:0%
while passing will earn you the title of Document Secretary.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.000 line:0%
However,

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.120 line:0%
if you take the exam as a Document Secretary,

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:48.200 line:0%
the risk will be much higher.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.440 line:0%
If you fail,

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.600 line:0%
you will be removed from the six ministries directly.

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.160 line:0%
But if you pass, you'll have the opportunity

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:57.090 line:0%
to be promoted to the position of Secretary of the Ministry of Justice.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:04.200 line:0%
Do you dare take the gamble?

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:16.400 line:0%
I will not let down the Grand Empress Dowager

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.880 line:0%
and Madam Xu's trust.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.010 line:0%
Good.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:23.000 line:0%
Madam Xu was right about you.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.200 line:0%
Document Secretary Yan,

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:26.440 line:0%
I

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.480 line:0%
look forward to your performance.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:48.000 line:0%
You and Shen Du really are a loving couple,

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:49.560 line:0%
enviable to others.

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.430 line:0%
Actually, he...

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:56.200 line:0%
Actually, he has already sent me a message,

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:58.510 line:0%
asking me to take extra care of you.

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.400 line:0%
He was afraid that you might be nervous

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.860 line:0%
and make mistakes when meeting Her Majesty.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:05.920 line:0%
Maybe...

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.040 line:0%
he was afraid I might

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.570 line:0%
embarrass the Shen family.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:10.440 line:0%
Is that so?

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.160 line:0%
I don't think so.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.340 line:0%
I've known him for many years,

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:17.940 line:0%
and I've never seen him

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.650 line:0%
so concerned about anyone.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.280 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.770 line:0%
thank you for protecting me today,

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.660 line:0%
and thank you for telling me this.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.280 line:0%
I'm very happy.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:32.170 line:0%
I also want to thank you for your trust.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.440 line:0%
That day,

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:35.360 line:0%
when Jing Lin gave me the memorial

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.620 line:0%
of the Chen Huo'e case,

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:38.960 line:0%
I immediately understood your intentions.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.680 line:0%
Though we haven't interacted much,

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:42.520 line:0%
you entrusted your life

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.040 line:0%
and future to me.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:49.480 line:0%
I believe in you,

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.510 line:0%
and I believe that Shen Du

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:53.040 line:0%
wouldn't misjudge people.

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:03.080 line:0%
But I think

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:04.680 line:0%
my wife is wonderful.

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:07.360 line:0%
This one it is.

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:08.920 line:0%
The design is simple.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:10.510 line:0%
It suits you well.

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:14.040 line:0%
Although there's someone

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:15.440 line:0%
you can't forget,

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:18.110 line:0%
you have been treating me sincerely.

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:21.080 line:0%
Since the 3-month period isn't over yet,

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:22.200 line:0%
let's cherish

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:23.490 line:0%
every remaining day.

00:22:42.480 --> 00:22:44.530 line:0%
I, Yan Caiwei, greet Your Highness.

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:02.720 line:0%
Alright.

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:05.200 line:0%
I heard that you and Mr. Han

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:06.600 line:0%
are about to get married,

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:09.560 line:0%
so I came specially to offer my congratulations.

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:11.020 line:0%
Thank you, Your Highness.

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:13.120 line:0%
Why thank me?

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:15.360 line:0%
You're the one who's getting married.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.160 line:0%
What does it have to do with me?

00:23:22.800 --> 00:23:24.000 line:0%
Your ambitions

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:26.280 line:0%
are too high.

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:29.130 line:0%
I heard that back then,

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:32.490 line:0%
even Grand Commander Shen wasn't good enough in your eyes.

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:35.110 line:0%
But unfortunately,

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:39.440 line:0%
your taste really isn't that great.

00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:06.350 line:0%
Today, you'll have a cup of tea from me,

00:24:06.970 --> 00:24:08.590 line:0%
and I'll wish

00:24:09.610 --> 00:24:11.140 line:0%
that your wishes come true.

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:16.690 line:0%
If your wedding doesn't happen,

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:19.430 line:0%
don't say I hindered it.

00:25:05.060 --> 00:25:13.490 line:0%
[Guangyue Restaurant]

00:25:14.840 --> 00:25:15.640 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:16.770 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:25:17.120 --> 00:25:17.920 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:25:24.900 --> 00:25:31.670 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:25:29.760 --> 00:25:31.280 line:0%
Lady Xing, Lady Xing!

00:25:32.040 --> 00:25:33.920 line:0%
Master asked you to go back home immediately.

00:25:33.920 --> 00:25:35.850 line:0%
Something happened to Lady Caiwei.

00:25:35.850 --> 00:25:37.670 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:25:42.380 --> 00:25:43.360 line:0%
Mr. Han,

00:25:43.360 --> 00:25:45.020 line:0%
let me check on Sister Caiwei.

00:25:54.330 --> 00:25:55.290 line:0%
What is this?

00:25:57.370 --> 00:25:59.730 line:0%
There's more threads now than there was during the day.

00:25:59.730 --> 00:26:01.600 line:0%
You must save Caiwei.

00:26:04.360 --> 00:26:05.160 line:0%
Xing,

00:26:05.800 --> 00:26:06.640 line:0%
during the day,

00:26:06.640 --> 00:26:08.000 line:0%
we invited an imperial physician from the palace

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:09.120 line:0%
to examine her,

00:26:09.180 --> 00:26:10.240 line:0%
but after thorough examinations,

00:26:10.240 --> 00:26:12.130 line:0%
he couldn't diagnose any illness.

00:26:12.130 --> 00:26:14.860 line:0%
Have you ever seen a symptom like this?

00:26:25.200 --> 00:26:27.460 line:0%
I can't tell what illness this is either,

00:26:32.720 --> 00:26:34.330 line:0%
but looking at how Sister Caiwei is,

00:26:34.330 --> 00:26:36.130 line:0%
it doesn't seem like an illness.

00:26:36.250 --> 00:26:37.910 line:0%
It seems more like poisoning.

00:26:39.520 --> 00:26:40.510 line:0%
Poisoning?

00:26:41.730 --> 00:26:43.210 line:0%
Which bastard

00:26:43.240 --> 00:26:44.780 line:0%
is trying to harm my daughter?

00:26:44.780 --> 00:26:45.580 line:0%
Poisoning?

00:26:54.220 --> 00:26:55.460 line:0%
It's Princess Yong'an.

00:26:55.460 --> 00:26:56.520 line:0%
Caiwei went to see

00:26:56.520 --> 00:26:57.280 line:0%
Princess Yong'an today.

00:26:57.280 --> 00:26:59.680 line:0%
Harming my daughter wasn't enough for you?

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:00.960 line:0%
Why did you provoke

00:27:00.960 --> 00:27:02.720 line:0%
Princess Yong'an?

00:27:02.890 --> 00:27:04.090 line:0%
Don't talk nonsense!

00:27:04.280 --> 00:27:05.080 line:0%
How could Princess Yong'an

00:27:05.080 --> 00:27:06.800 line:0%
have poisoned Caiwei?

00:27:10.400 --> 00:27:11.200 line:0%
Xing,

00:27:11.680 --> 00:27:12.760 line:0%
don't try to show off.

00:27:12.760 --> 00:27:14.240 line:0%
The imperial physician from the palace has already examined her.

00:27:14.240 --> 00:27:15.280 line:0%
How come you're the only one who figured out

00:27:15.280 --> 00:27:16.210 line:0%
it's poisoning?

00:27:20.250 --> 00:27:22.140 line:0%
I just feel like it's poisoning,

00:27:22.330 --> 00:27:24.180 line:0%
but I can't confirm what kind of poison it is,

00:27:24.180 --> 00:27:26.240 line:0%
and I certainly can't tell who did it.

00:27:29.970 --> 00:27:32.370 line:0%
There are translucent threads on her body,

00:27:32.950 --> 00:27:34.150 line:0%
like silkworm pupae.

00:27:37.670 --> 00:27:38.600 line:0%
Silkworm pupae?

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:42.080 line:0%
Could it be...

00:27:43.490 --> 00:27:44.610 line:0%
that Chen Huo'e did it?

00:27:44.610 --> 00:27:45.680 line:0%
Impossible.

00:27:45.890 --> 00:27:47.410 line:0%
Chen Huo'e has already been executed,

00:27:47.410 --> 00:27:48.940 line:0%
and I saw it with my own eyes.

00:27:49.010 --> 00:27:51.340 line:0%
She couldn't have poisoned anyone again.

00:27:56.400 --> 00:27:57.590 line:0%
I see.

00:27:57.840 --> 00:27:59.000 line:0%
I went to the Imperial Security Bureau

00:27:59.000 --> 00:28:01.040 line:0%
and asked Guard Jing to check the archives.

00:28:01.040 --> 00:28:02.840 line:0%
When the Fire Moth Sect caused trouble in the past,

00:28:02.840 --> 00:28:03.600 line:0%
they used a poison

00:28:03.600 --> 00:28:05.060 line:0%
called Metamorphosis.

00:28:12.060 --> 00:28:12.950 line:0%
Mojie,

00:28:12.970 --> 00:28:14.560 line:0%
Chen Huo'e has already been executed.

00:28:14.560 --> 00:28:15.600 line:0%
Is there any chance we can find

00:28:15.600 --> 00:28:17.070 line:0%
any remaining followers of the Fire Moth Sect?

00:28:17.070 --> 00:28:19.060 line:0%
This is the difficulty in saving her.

00:28:19.060 --> 00:28:20.520 line:0%
After Chen Huo'e's death,

00:28:20.640 --> 00:28:21.520 line:0%
it was as if the Fire Moth Sect

00:28:21.520 --> 00:28:22.520 line:0%
vanished into thin air.

00:28:22.520 --> 00:28:24.120 line:0%
There's no trace left at all.

00:28:24.840 --> 00:28:25.960 line:0%
There are no clues even in the archives

00:28:25.960 --> 00:28:27.480 line:0%
of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:28:27.480 --> 00:28:29.210 line:0%
Where can we go to investigate?

00:28:29.240 --> 00:28:30.100 line:0%
Are we supposed

00:28:31.460 --> 00:28:33.210 line:0%
to find Princess Yong'an?

00:28:39.600 --> 00:28:41.960 line:0%
Since it was Chen Huo'e who poisoned her,

00:28:42.440 --> 00:28:43.360 line:0%
stop bringing up

00:28:43.360 --> 00:28:44.890 line:0%
Princess Yong'an anymore.

00:28:45.280 --> 00:28:47.350 line:0%
If this involves Princess Yong'an,

00:28:47.600 --> 00:28:48.920 line:0%
implicating the royal family

00:28:48.920 --> 00:28:50.200 line:0%
is no small matter.

00:28:50.520 --> 00:28:51.920 line:0%
Have you forgotten about

00:28:52.630 --> 00:28:54.830 line:0%
the extermination of Jinxiu Workshop?

00:28:58.960 --> 00:29:01.490 line:0%
Since this is a poison from the Fire Moth Sect,

00:29:02.160 --> 00:29:03.560 line:0%
it's probably really not

00:29:04.070 --> 00:29:05.610 line:0%
Princess Yong'an's doing.

00:29:10.920 --> 00:29:11.720 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:29:13.310 --> 00:29:14.250 line:0%
I'm afraid your third sister

00:29:14.250 --> 00:29:16.250 line:0%
has been implicated because of you.

00:29:18.600 --> 00:29:20.130 line:0%
-Han Shiyuan, you...
-Mom.

00:29:22.530 --> 00:29:24.050 line:0%
Mr. Han was right.

00:29:25.310 --> 00:29:26.610 line:0%
I'm afraid this time,

00:29:26.630 --> 00:29:28.300 line:0%
Sister Caiwei has indeed been implicated because of me

00:29:28.300 --> 00:29:31.300 line:0%
and was targeted by the remnants of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:29:34.660 --> 00:29:36.300 line:0%
It was my fault.

00:29:41.740 --> 00:29:42.800 line:0%
Don't worry,

00:29:43.200 --> 00:29:44.910 line:0%
Even if I have to risk my life,

00:29:44.970 --> 00:29:47.030 line:0%
I'll definitely save Sister Caiwei.

00:29:47.240 --> 00:29:48.040 line:0%
Stop!

00:29:57.490 --> 00:30:00.090 line:0%
Who are you going to risk your life against now?

00:30:02.260 --> 00:30:03.320 line:0%
Do you want me

00:30:03.320 --> 00:30:05.160 line:0%
to lose another daughter?

00:30:17.560 --> 00:30:18.360 line:0%
Father.

00:30:20.710 --> 00:30:21.710 line:0%
Xing.

00:30:24.210 --> 00:30:26.470 line:0%
You are my daughter too.

00:30:41.250 --> 00:30:42.850 line:0%
Father, please don't worry.

00:30:43.000 --> 00:30:44.600 line:0%
I will be careful.

00:30:45.370 --> 00:30:46.610 line:0%
And I will definitely

00:30:46.770 --> 00:30:48.250 line:0%
save Sister Caiwei.

00:31:01.070 --> 00:31:03.730 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:31:17.800 --> 00:31:18.600 line:0%
Not this one.

00:31:27.570 --> 00:31:29.000 line:0%
Metamorphosis...

00:31:30.190 --> 00:31:31.760 line:0%
Where is the antidote formula

00:31:31.760 --> 00:31:32.960 line:0%
for Metamorphosis?

00:31:47.500 --> 00:31:50.620 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:32:02.420 --> 00:32:03.710 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:32:04.750 --> 00:32:05.800 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:32:10.590 --> 00:32:15.350 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:32:23.590 --> 00:32:24.590 line:0%
Mom,

00:32:26.660 --> 00:32:28.590 line:0%
I haven't come to see you recently.

00:32:31.310 --> 00:32:33.300 line:0%
Are you angry with me?

00:32:35.380 --> 00:32:37.770 line:0%
I actually wanted to come.

00:32:42.400 --> 00:32:43.520 line:0%
It's just that...

00:32:51.690 --> 00:32:53.490 line:0%
I was afraid I might see someone.

00:33:07.140 --> 00:33:08.320 line:0%
That person

00:33:10.410 --> 00:33:12.560 line:0%
is usually a great demon

00:33:14.350 --> 00:33:16.180 line:0%
that everyone fears,

00:33:19.560 --> 00:33:22.420 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:33:29.460 --> 00:33:32.460 line:0%
but when he disguised himself as a mysterious person,

00:33:37.470 --> 00:33:38.790 line:0%
he's interesting

00:33:38.810 --> 00:33:40.250 line:0%
and considerate,

00:33:43.080 --> 00:33:45.040 line:0%
like a completely

00:33:45.520 --> 00:33:46.880 line:0%
different person.

00:33:51.600 --> 00:33:52.400 line:0%
Mom,

00:33:53.180 --> 00:33:54.760 line:0%
you've met him too.

00:33:55.820 --> 00:33:58.280 line:0%
At that time, I even considered him a friend.

00:34:02.780 --> 00:34:04.260 line:0%
His mom

00:34:04.680 --> 00:34:05.620 line:0%
must have

00:34:05.650 --> 00:34:07.780 line:0%
become close friends with you, right?

00:34:10.160 --> 00:34:11.189 line:0%
Mom,

00:34:12.110 --> 00:34:13.920 line:0%
you also don't think he's a bad person,

00:34:13.920 --> 00:34:14.640 line:0%
right?

00:34:14.370 --> 00:34:16.900 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:34:17.470 --> 00:34:18.280 line:0%
So...

00:34:20.670 --> 00:34:22.700 line:0%
what should I do?

00:34:28.600 --> 00:34:29.360 line:0%
You can just treat me

00:34:29.360 --> 00:34:30.689 line:0%
as a mysterious person,

00:34:31.990 --> 00:34:32.920 line:0%
Ghost Face.

00:34:38.560 --> 00:34:39.680 line:0%
You...

00:34:40.180 --> 00:34:41.630 line:0%
You're here?

00:34:42.340 --> 00:34:43.590 line:0%
I'm always here.

00:34:49.320 --> 00:34:50.120 line:0%
Lord...

00:34:51.189 --> 00:34:52.220 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:34:53.950 --> 00:34:55.010 line:0%
I've already said,

00:34:56.090 --> 00:34:57.140 line:0%
here,

00:34:58.100 --> 00:34:59.040 line:0%
you can continue to treat me

00:34:59.040 --> 00:35:00.080 line:0%
as Ghost Face,

00:35:04.040 --> 00:35:04.840 line:0%
as a friend.

00:35:14.800 --> 00:35:17.000 line:0%
Even the Black Rakshasa needs friends?

00:35:19.480 --> 00:35:20.280 line:0%
Perhaps

00:35:21.760 --> 00:35:22.820 line:0%
we can give it a try.

00:35:27.200 --> 00:35:28.000 line:0%
True.

00:35:28.120 --> 00:35:30.140 line:0%
Even the White Ghost can get married,

00:35:30.140 --> 00:35:31.340 line:0%
so the Black Rakshasa

00:35:31.440 --> 00:35:32.240 line:0%
surely needs

00:35:32.240 --> 00:35:33.370 line:0%
to make friends too.

00:35:34.520 --> 00:35:35.320 line:0%
However,

00:35:35.360 --> 00:35:36.780 line:0%
my friends and I

00:35:36.810 --> 00:35:38.520 line:0%
communicate on equal terms.

00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:39.360 line:0%
And we should

00:35:39.360 --> 00:35:40.690 line:0%
help each other

00:35:40.800 --> 00:35:42.760 line:0%
and share secrets with each other.

00:35:43.440 --> 00:35:44.860 line:0%
You...

00:35:45.280 --> 00:35:46.950 line:0%
Why don't you share first?

00:35:47.160 --> 00:35:48.160 line:0%
Let me hear it.

00:35:52.520 --> 00:35:54.280 line:0%
Share secrets?

00:35:56.920 --> 00:35:57.920 line:0%
I seem to

00:35:57.920 --> 00:35:59.650 line:0%
really have no secrets lately.

00:36:00.440 --> 00:36:01.310 line:0%
However,

00:36:01.480 --> 00:36:03.840 line:0%
I've spent all my pocket money

00:36:03.920 --> 00:36:05.560 line:0%
and went to Shen's Mansion for a meal.

00:36:05.560 --> 00:36:06.490 line:0%
Does that count?

00:36:10.880 --> 00:36:11.680 line:0%
Alright.

00:36:12.200 --> 00:36:13.000 line:0%
It's my turn.

00:36:13.640 --> 00:36:14.360 line:0%
Do you really have a secret

00:36:14.360 --> 00:36:15.290 line:0%
to share with me?

00:36:18.000 --> 00:36:19.120 line:0%
I know you and Yan Xing

00:36:19.120 --> 00:36:20.720 line:0%
are colleagues and friends.

00:36:20.960 --> 00:36:22.340 line:0%
I heard her third sister

00:36:22.440 --> 00:36:23.400 line:0%
was poisoned by the Fire Moth Sect's

00:36:23.400 --> 00:36:24.800 line:0%
Metamorphosis poison.

00:36:25.560 --> 00:36:26.360 line:0%
And

00:36:27.080 --> 00:36:28.460 line:0%
I happen to have

00:36:28.960 --> 00:36:31.560 line:0%
the antidote formula for Metamorphosis.

00:36:31.600 --> 00:36:33.010 line:0%
Why do you have the antidote formula?

00:36:32.740 --> 00:36:36.260 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:36:33.640 --> 00:36:35.160 line:0%
Chen Huo'e was captured and interrogated twice

00:36:35.160 --> 00:36:37.620 line:0%
by the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:36:37.620 --> 00:36:39.170 line:0%
You must know about this.

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:42.290 line:0%
It was during that time

00:36:42.960 --> 00:36:44.760 line:0%
that I got the antidote formula.

00:36:46.450 --> 00:36:47.630 line:0%
Then why...

00:36:48.330 --> 00:36:49.700 line:0%
are you giving it to me?

00:36:49.850 --> 00:36:51.310 line:0%
I can give you the formula,

00:36:51.920 --> 00:36:53.320 line:0%
but I have one condition.

00:36:53.330 --> 00:36:54.380 line:0%
What condition?

00:36:54.520 --> 00:36:56.230 line:0%
Don't say it was from me.

00:36:57.880 --> 00:36:58.680 line:0%
Why?

00:36:59.160 --> 00:37:00.480 line:0%
You did a good deed.

00:37:03.080 --> 00:37:04.760 line:0%
Why can't I say

00:37:04.760 --> 00:37:05.680 line:0%
it was from you?

00:37:08.520 --> 00:37:10.610 line:0%
You can of course choose not to believe me.

00:37:10.610 --> 00:37:13.070 line:0%
Yan Xing can choose not to believe me either.

00:37:13.240 --> 00:37:14.000 line:0%
On the one hand, this formula

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:16.080 line:0%
has yet to be verified for authenticity.

00:37:16.080 --> 00:37:17.200 line:0%
If it can't cure the poison

00:37:17.200 --> 00:37:18.730 line:0%
or if it worsens her condition,

00:37:18.730 --> 00:37:20.360 line:0%
I won't take responsibility.

00:37:20.360 --> 00:37:21.360 line:0%
On the other hand,

00:37:21.890 --> 00:37:23.770 line:0%
there's a catalyst in the formula

00:37:24.160 --> 00:37:25.320 line:0%
that's hard to find in the worldâ€”

00:37:25.320 --> 00:37:27.780 line:0%
the heart's blood of a mirror-image person.

00:37:30.440 --> 00:37:31.770 line:0%
Whether it can be found

00:37:32.630 --> 00:37:34.950 line:0%
depends on Yan Caiwei's fate.

00:38:00.240 --> 00:38:01.040 line:0%
Xing.

00:38:05.560 --> 00:38:07.560 line:0%
You stayed up all night to read them?

00:38:09.090 --> 00:38:10.040 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:38:10.560 --> 00:38:12.280 line:0%
I can't accompany you today.

00:38:12.600 --> 00:38:13.720 line:0%
I'm looking for

00:38:13.720 --> 00:38:15.380 line:0%
a life-saving prescription.

00:38:19.080 --> 00:38:19.880 line:0%
Xing,

00:38:20.600 --> 00:38:22.600 line:0%
would you like to take a look at this?

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:39.930 line:0%
The antidote formula for Metamorphosis?

00:38:41.760 --> 00:38:42.480 line:0%
How did you know

00:38:42.480 --> 00:38:44.140 line:0%
my third sister was poisoned?

00:38:45.130 --> 00:38:46.240 line:0%
Where did you

00:38:46.280 --> 00:38:47.660 line:0%
get this formula?

00:38:48.120 --> 00:38:49.900 line:0%
It-it was from a friend of mine.

00:38:50.790 --> 00:38:51.750 line:0%
Friend?

00:38:52.630 --> 00:38:53.920 line:0%
Since when did you have

00:38:53.920 --> 00:38:55.560 line:0%
such a powerful friend?

00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:57.600 line:0%
Well...

00:38:58.360 --> 00:39:00.240 line:0%
Anyway, this prescription seems

00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:01.760 line:0%
to have leaked

00:39:01.760 --> 00:39:02.920 line:0%
from the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:39:02.920 --> 00:39:03.720 line:0%
It's said to have been obtained

00:39:03.720 --> 00:39:05.980 line:0%
during the interrogation of Chen Huo'e.

00:39:06.000 --> 00:39:06.800 line:0%
But I'm not sure

00:39:06.800 --> 00:39:08.560 line:0%
if this prescription is real or not.

00:39:08.560 --> 00:39:10.280 line:0%
I don't know if it's useful.

00:39:10.300 --> 00:39:12.430 line:0%
Imperial Investigation Department?

00:39:13.240 --> 00:39:14.650 line:0%
Chen Huo'e?

00:39:17.210 --> 00:39:19.470 line:0%
The person who made the poison can also make the antidote.

00:39:19.470 --> 00:39:21.670 line:0%
Then who could be the one who poisoned her?

00:39:21.670 --> 00:39:22.680 line:0%
Why did you

00:39:22.680 --> 00:39:24.760 line:0%
just happen to get this prescription?

00:39:24.760 --> 00:39:25.560 line:0%
I...

00:39:26.050 --> 00:39:27.600 line:0%
Never mind about where this prescription was from for now.

00:39:27.600 --> 00:39:28.240 line:0%
I think you should

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:29.680 line:0%
go to a clinic now

00:39:29.720 --> 00:39:30.840 line:0%
to verify whether this prescription

00:39:30.840 --> 00:39:32.360 line:0%
is real or fake

00:39:32.360 --> 00:39:33.620 line:0%
and if it's poisonous.

00:39:33.680 --> 00:39:35.680 line:0%
And even if it is real,

00:39:35.680 --> 00:39:36.560 line:0%
it requires

00:39:36.560 --> 00:39:37.880 line:0%
the heart's blood of a mirror-image person

00:39:37.880 --> 00:39:38.840 line:0%
as a catalyst.

00:39:39.640 --> 00:39:40.480 line:0%
But...

00:39:40.680 --> 00:39:41.600 line:0%
wasn't

00:39:41.600 --> 00:39:43.000 line:0%
Chen Huo'e the only mirror-image person

00:39:43.000 --> 00:39:44.120 line:0%
in the world?

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:45.080 line:0%
Besides,

00:39:45.080 --> 00:39:47.010 line:0%
wasn't she killed by your husband,

00:39:47.360 --> 00:39:48.720 line:0%
the White Ghost?

00:39:50.270 --> 00:39:51.260 line:0%
Yes.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:54.060 line:0%
Chen Huo'e is dead.

00:39:55.600 --> 00:39:56.930 line:0%
Now, where in this world

00:39:57.460 --> 00:39:58.320 line:0%
can we find

00:39:58.320 --> 00:40:00.120 line:0%
a known mirror-image person?

00:40:02.950 --> 00:40:05.320 line:0%
Master Chen Wen has gone into the mountains for fasting,

00:40:05.320 --> 00:40:06.400 line:0%
and there's no set return date.

00:40:06.400 --> 00:40:08.300 line:0%
Miss Yan, you should know this.

00:40:08.590 --> 00:40:09.840 line:0%
Commander Xu?

00:40:09.910 --> 00:40:10.970 line:0%
Not to mention you,

00:40:11.040 --> 00:40:14.170 line:0%
I haven't seen Commander Xu for the past few days either.

00:40:43.080 --> 00:40:44.020 line:0%
Excuse me,

00:40:44.050 --> 00:40:46.130 line:0%
do you know where Pan Chi has gone?

00:40:47.380 --> 00:40:48.710 line:0%
You're looking for Pan?

00:40:49.570 --> 00:40:51.370 line:0%
He's been gone for several days.

00:40:52.430 --> 00:40:54.260 line:0%
I heard he went

00:40:54.570 --> 00:40:55.830 line:0%
with a beautiful woman

00:40:55.950 --> 00:40:58.770 line:0%
to chase after that merchant caravan from Xichen.

00:41:00.470 --> 00:41:02.100 line:0%
Young people are really reckless.

00:41:02.100 --> 00:41:03.310 line:0%
So reckless.

00:41:16.800 --> 00:41:17.660 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:41:18.240 --> 00:41:20.120 line:0%
Yan Caiwei was poisoned.

00:41:22.360 --> 00:41:23.910 line:0%
Yan Caiwei was poisoned?

00:41:24.280 --> 00:41:25.080 line:0%
I heard

00:41:25.100 --> 00:41:26.960 line:0%
it's an incurable deadly poison.

00:41:29.790 --> 00:41:31.930 line:0%
I only added

00:41:32.160 --> 00:41:33.530 line:0%
some herbs to her tea

00:41:33.560 --> 00:41:34.640 line:0%
that cause

00:41:34.640 --> 00:41:35.800 line:0%
disturbing dreams

00:41:35.800 --> 00:41:36.860 line:0%
as a gesture of warning.

00:41:36.860 --> 00:41:38.900 line:0%
I've already consulted the imperial physician.

00:41:38.900 --> 00:41:40.560 line:0%
It was no danger to her life.

00:41:40.990 --> 00:41:41.930 line:0%
Then it seems

00:41:42.850 --> 00:41:44.800 line:0%
someone is trying to frame you.

00:41:47.250 --> 00:41:48.050 line:0%
Indeed.

00:41:49.260 --> 00:41:50.060 line:0%
Frame.

00:41:52.470 --> 00:41:53.720 line:0%
Yan Caiwei's life

00:41:53.720 --> 00:41:55.040 line:0%
may be insignificant,

00:41:55.540 --> 00:41:57.120 line:0%
but her father, Dr. Yan,

00:41:57.120 --> 00:41:59.090 line:0%
is working for Prime Minister Zhang,

00:41:59.090 --> 00:42:00.600 line:0%
and her sister, Yan Xing,

00:42:00.600 --> 00:42:02.080 line:0%
is Shen Du's wife.

00:42:02.350 --> 00:42:03.770 line:0%
If she dies,

00:42:04.650 --> 00:42:06.970 line:0%
won't I be at odds

00:42:07.250 --> 00:42:08.200 line:0%
with Prince Xian's faction

00:42:08.200 --> 00:42:10.130 line:0%
and the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:42:10.570 --> 00:42:12.300 line:0%
The person who poisoned her

00:42:12.580 --> 00:42:14.810 line:0%
must have had such a malicious intent.

00:42:16.080 --> 00:42:16.880 line:0%
Beat him!

00:42:16.900 --> 00:42:17.840 line:0%
Beat him hard!